This '''village''' was located on a [[Unidentified moon (Najra-Va)|moon]] of the [[planet]] [[Najra-Va]] in the [[Dassal system]] in the [[Unknown Regions]]. Its major focal point was a large temple. At some point, its population was massacred, prior to the system's [[Dassal system's sun|sun]] vanishing.<ref name="The Core Problem" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> [[Resistance]] members [[Commander]] [[Poe Dameron]] and [[Kazuda Xiono]] [[Mission to the Dassal system|investigated]] the [[star system]] and discovered the ruins of the village, deducing that a massacre had occurred. Xiono retrieved a child's [[doll]] from the ruins of the temple before the two encountered a [[First Order]] [[Spider probe droid|probe]] [[Probe droid|droid]] that had been left at the village.<ref name="The Core Problem" />

